{"seq":4,"slug":"navigation-compose","title":"导航","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/jetpack-compose/navigation-compose","wordCount":652,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"导航\">导航</h1><p>Jetpack Compose 的 Navigation 组件提供声明式导航方案，支持类型安全的路由、Deep Link 和嵌套导航图。通过 Kotlin Serialization 实现的类型安全导航消除了传统字符串路由的类型不安全问题。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Compose 导航围绕三个核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>NavHost 与 NavGraph</strong>：<code>NavHost</code> 是承载导航的容器，<code>NavGraph</code> 声明所有可达目的地及其关系；通过 <code>rememberNavController()</code> 驱动的 <code>navigate()</code> / <code>popBackStack()</code> 完成前进与返回。</li>\n<li><strong>类型安全路由</strong>：用 Kotlin Serialization 的 <code>@Serializable</code> 类型替代字符串路由，参数被自动序列化与解析，带来编译时类型检查和重构友好性（Navigation 2.8.0 起支持）。</li>\n<li><strong>Deep Link 与嵌套导航</strong>：<code>navDeepLink</code> 配合清单 <code>intent-filter</code> 让外部 URL 直达应用内页面；<code>navigation&lt;T&gt;</code> 把相关页面组织成嵌套图，适配底部导航栏并配合 <code>saveState</code> / <code>restoreState</code> 保持各 Tab 状态。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"navhost-与-navgraph\">NavHost 与 NavGraph</h2><p><code>NavHost</code> 是导航的容器，<code>NavGraph</code> 定义了导航图中所有可达目的地和它们之间的关系。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun AppNavigation() {&#10;    val navController = rememberNavController()&#10;&#10;    NavHost(&#10;        navController = navController,&#10;        startDestination = &quot;home&quot;&#10;    ) {&#10;        composable(&quot;home&quot;) {&#10;            HomeScreen(&#10;                onNavigateToDetail = { id -&gt; navController.navigate(&quot;detail/$id&quot;) },&#10;                onNavigateToSettings = { navController.navigate(&quot;settings&quot;) }&#10;            )&#10;        }&#10;        composable(&#10;            route = &quot;detail/{itemId}&quot;,&#10;            arguments = listOf(navArgument(&quot;itemId&quot;) { type = NavType.StringType })&#10;        ) { backStackEntry -&gt;&#10;            val itemId = backStackEntry.arguments?.getString(&quot;itemId&quot;) ?: return@composable&#10;            DetailScreen(itemId = itemId)&#10;        }&#10;        composable(&quot;settings&quot;) {&#10;            SettingsScreen(onBack = { navController.popBackStack() })&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun AppNavigation() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val navController = rememberNavController()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    NavHost(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        navController = navController,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        startDestination = \"home\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composable(\"home\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            HomeScreen(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                onNavigateToDetail = { id -> navController.navigate(\"detail/$id\") },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                onNavigateToSettings = { navController.navigate(\"settings\") }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composable(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            route = \"detail/{itemId}\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            arguments = listOf(navArgument(\"itemId\") { type = NavType.StringType })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ) { backStackEntry -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val itemId = backStackEntry.arguments?.getString(\"itemId\") ?: return@composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            DetailScreen(itemId = itemId)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composable(\"settings\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            SettingsScreen(onBack = { navController.popBackStack() })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[HomeScreen] --&gt;|navigate detail/id| B[DetailScreen]&#10;    A --&gt;|navigate settings| C[SettingsScreen]&#10;    B --&gt;|popBackStack| A&#10;    C --&gt;|popBackStack| A&#10;&#10;    classDef screenStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class A,B,C screenStyle\">graph LR\n    A[HomeScreen] --&gt;|navigate detail/id| B[DetailScreen]\n    A --&gt;|navigate settings| C[SettingsScreen]\n    B --&gt;|popBackStack| A\n    C --&gt;|popBackStack| A\n\n    classDef screenStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class A,B,C screenStyle</pre><p>导航操作对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>前进</td>\n<td><code>navigate(route)</code></td>\n<td>导航到目标页面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>返回</td>\n<td><code>popBackStack()</code></td>\n<td>返回上一页</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>返回到指定页</td>\n<td><code>popBackStack(route, inclusive)</code></td>\n<td>返回到指定目的地</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清栈导航</td>\n<td><code>navigate(route) { popUpTo(0) }</code></td>\n<td>清除回退栈后导航</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单实例</td>\n<td><code>navigate(route) { launchSingleTop = true }</code></td>\n<td>避免重复创建</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"类型安全导航-kotlin-serialization\">类型安全导航（Kotlin Serialization）</h2><p>使用 Kotlin Serialization 定义路由可以实现编译时类型检查，消除字符串路由的拼写错误风险。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Serializable&#10;data object Home&#10;&#10;@Serializable&#10;data class ProductDetail(val productId: String)&#10;&#10;@Serializable&#10;data class CategoryList(val category: String, val sortBy: String = &quot;name&quot;)&#10;&#10;@Serializable&#10;data object Settings&#10;&#10;@Serializable&#10;data object Profile&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;fun TypeSafeNavigation() {&#10;    val navController = rememberNavController()&#10;&#10;    NavHost(navController = navController, startDestination = Home) {&#10;        composable&lt;Home&gt; {&#10;            HomeScreen(&#10;                onProductClick = { id -&gt;&#10;                    navController.navigate(ProductDetail(productId = id))&#10;                },&#10;                onCategoryClick = { category -&gt;&#10;                    navController.navigate(CategoryList(category = category))&#10;                }&#10;            )&#10;        }&#10;        composable&lt;ProductDetail&gt; { backStackEntry -&gt;&#10;            val detail: ProductDetail = backStackEntry.toRoute()&#10;            ProductDetailScreen(productId = detail.productId)&#10;        }&#10;        composable&lt;CategoryList&gt; { backStackEntry -&gt;&#10;            val list: CategoryList = backStackEntry.toRoute()&#10;            CategoryListScreen(category = list.category, sortBy = list.sortBy)&#10;        }&#10;        composable&lt;Settings&gt; {&#10;            SettingsScreen()&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data object Home</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class ProductDetail(val productId: String)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class CategoryList(val category: String, val sortBy: String = \"name\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data object Settings</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data object Profile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun TypeSafeNavigation() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val navController = rememberNavController()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    NavHost(navController = navController, startDestination = Home) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composable&#x3C;Home> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            HomeScreen(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                onProductClick = { id -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    navController.navigate(ProductDetail(productId = id))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                onCategoryClick = { category -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    navController.navigate(CategoryList(category = category))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composable&#x3C;ProductDetail> { backStackEntry -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val detail: ProductDetail = backStackEntry.toRoute()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ProductDetailScreen(productId = detail.productId)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composable&#x3C;CategoryList> { backStackEntry -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val list: CategoryList = backStackEntry.toRoute()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            CategoryListScreen(category = list.category, sortBy = list.sortBy)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composable&#x3C;Settings> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            SettingsScreen()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>字符串路由</th>\n<th>类型安全路由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>类型检查</td>\n<td>运行时</td>\n<td>编译时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参数传递</td>\n<td>手动拼接/解析</td>\n<td>自动序列化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>默认值</td>\n<td>手动处理</td>\n<td>数据类默认值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重构友好</td>\n<td>否（字符串不跟随重命名）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖</td>\n<td>无额外依赖</td>\n<td>需要 Kotlin Serialization</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 类型安全导航从 Navigation 2.8.0 开始支持，推荐所有新项目使用此方式。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"deep-link\">Deep Link</h2><p>Deep Link 允许外部 URL 直接导航到应用内的特定页面。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Serializable&#10;data class Article(val articleId: String)&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;fun DeepLinkNavigation() {&#10;    val navController = rememberNavController()&#10;&#10;    NavHost(navController = navController, startDestination = Home) {&#10;        composable&lt;Home&gt; { HomeScreen() }&#10;        composable&lt;Article&gt;(&#10;            deepLinks = listOf(&#10;                navDeepLink&lt;Article&gt;(basePath = &quot;https://myapp.com/article&quot;)&#10;            )&#10;        ) { backStackEntry -&gt;&#10;            val article: Article = backStackEntry.toRoute()&#10;            ArticleScreen(articleId = article.articleId)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class Article(val articleId: String)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun DeepLinkNavigation() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val navController = rememberNavController()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    NavHost(navController = navController, startDestination = Home) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composable&#x3C;Home> { HomeScreen() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composable&#x3C;Article>(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            deepLinks = listOf(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                navDeepLink&#x3C;Article>(basePath = \"https://myapp.com/article\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ) { backStackEntry -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val article: Article = backStackEntry.toRoute()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ArticleScreen(articleId = article.articleId)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在 <code>AndroidManifest.xml</code> 中配合声明：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"xml\" data-code=\"&lt;activity android:name=&quot;.MainActivity&quot; android:exported=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;intent-filter android:autoVerify=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&#10;        &lt;action android:name=&quot;android.intent.action.VIEW&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;category android:name=&quot;android.intent.category.DEFAULT&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;category android:name=&quot;android.intent.category.BROWSABLE&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;data android:scheme=&quot;https&quot; android:host=&quot;myapp.com&quot; /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/intent-filter&gt;&#10;&lt;/activity&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">activity</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> android:name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\".MainActivity\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> android:exported</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"true\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">intent-filter</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> android:autoVerify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"true\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">action</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> android:name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"android.intent.action.VIEW\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">category</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> android:name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"android.intent.category.DEFAULT\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">category</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> android:name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"android.intent.category.BROWSABLE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">data</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> android:scheme</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> android:host</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"myapp.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">intent-filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">activity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant 外部&#10;    participant 系统&#10;    participant NavHost&#10;    participant 目标页面&#10;&#10;    外部-&gt;&gt;系统: https://myapp.com/article/abc123&#10;    系统-&gt;&gt;NavHost: 匹配 Deep Link 路由&#10;    NavHost-&gt;&gt;目标页面: 导航到 ArticleScreen(articleId=&quot;abc123&quot;)&#10;    Note over 目标页面: 正确恢复回退栈\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant 外部\n    participant 系统\n    participant NavHost\n    participant 目标页面\n\n    外部-&gt;&gt;系统: https://myapp.com/article/abc123\n    系统-&gt;&gt;NavHost: 匹配 Deep Link 路由\n    NavHost-&gt;&gt;目标页面: 导航到 ArticleScreen(articleId=\"abc123\")\n    Note over 目标页面: 正确恢复回退栈</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"嵌套导航\">嵌套导航</h2><p>嵌套导航图将相关页面组织在一起，适用于带底部导航栏或功能模块化的应用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Serializable data object HomeGraph&#10;@Serializable data object HomeFeed&#10;@Serializable data class HomeDetail(val id: String)&#10;&#10;@Serializable data object SearchGraph&#10;@Serializable data object SearchMain&#10;@Serializable data class SearchResult(val query: String)&#10;&#10;@Serializable data object ProfileGraph&#10;@Serializable data object ProfileMain&#10;@Serializable data object ProfileEdit&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;fun MainScreen() {&#10;    val navController = rememberNavController()&#10;&#10;    Scaffold(&#10;        bottomBar = {&#10;            NavigationBar {&#10;                val currentRoute = navController.currentBackStackEntryAsState()&#10;                    .value?.destination?.route&#10;&#10;                NavigationBarItem(&#10;                    selected = currentRoute?.contains(&quot;Home&quot;) == true,&#10;                    onClick = {&#10;                        navController.navigate(HomeGraph) {&#10;                            popUpTo(navController.graph.findStartDestination().id) {&#10;                                saveState = true&#10;                            }&#10;                            launchSingleTop = true&#10;                            restoreState = true&#10;                        }&#10;                    },&#10;                    icon = { Icon(Icons.Default.Home, contentDescription = null) },&#10;                    label = { Text(&quot;首页&quot;) }&#10;                )&#10;                NavigationBarItem(&#10;                    selected = currentRoute?.contains(&quot;Search&quot;) == true,&#10;                    onClick = {&#10;                        navController.navigate(SearchGraph) {&#10;                            popUpTo(navController.graph.findStartDestination().id) {&#10;                                saveState = true&#10;                            }&#10;                            launchSingleTop = true&#10;                            restoreState = true&#10;                        }&#10;                    },&#10;                    icon = { Icon(Icons.Default.Search, contentDescription = null) },&#10;                    label = { Text(&quot;搜索&quot;) }&#10;                )&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    ) { padding -&gt;&#10;        NavHost(&#10;            navController = navController,&#10;            startDestination = HomeGraph,&#10;            modifier = Modifier.padding(padding)&#10;        ) {&#10;            navigation&lt;HomeGraph&gt;(startDestination = HomeFeed) {&#10;                composable&lt;HomeFeed&gt; { HomeFeedScreen() }&#10;                composable&lt;HomeDetail&gt; { DetailScreen() }&#10;            }&#10;            navigation&lt;SearchGraph&gt;(startDestination = SearchMain) {&#10;                composable&lt;SearchMain&gt; { SearchScreen() }&#10;                composable&lt;SearchResult&gt; { ResultScreen() }&#10;            }&#10;            navigation&lt;ProfileGraph&gt;(startDestination = ProfileMain) {&#10;                composable&lt;ProfileMain&gt; { ProfileScreen() }&#10;                composable&lt;ProfileEdit&gt; { EditProfileScreen() }&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable data object HomeGraph</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable data object HomeFeed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable data class HomeDetail(val id: String)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable data object SearchGraph</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable data object SearchMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable data class SearchResult(val query: String)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable data object ProfileGraph</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable data object ProfileMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable data object ProfileEdit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun MainScreen() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val navController = rememberNavController()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Scaffold(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        bottomBar = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            NavigationBar {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                val currentRoute = navController.currentBackStackEntryAsState()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    .value?.destination?.route</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                NavigationBarItem(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    selected = currentRoute?.contains(\"Home\") == true,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    onClick = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        navController.navigate(HomeGraph) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            popUpTo(navController.graph.findStartDestination().id) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                saveState = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            launchSingleTop = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            restoreState = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    icon = { Icon(Icons.Default.Home, contentDescription = null) },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    label = { Text(\"首页\") }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                NavigationBarItem(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    selected = currentRoute?.contains(\"Search\") == true,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    onClick = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        navController.navigate(SearchGraph) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            popUpTo(navController.graph.findStartDestination().id) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                saveState = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            launchSingleTop = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            restoreState = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    icon = { Icon(Icons.Default.Search, contentDescription = null) },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    label = { Text(\"搜索\") }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) { padding -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        NavHost(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            navController = navController,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            startDestination = HomeGraph,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            modifier = Modifier.padding(padding)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            navigation&#x3C;HomeGraph>(startDestination = HomeFeed) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                composable&#x3C;HomeFeed> { HomeFeedScreen() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                composable&#x3C;HomeDetail> { DetailScreen() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            navigation&#x3C;SearchGraph>(startDestination = SearchMain) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                composable&#x3C;SearchMain> { SearchScreen() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                composable&#x3C;SearchResult> { ResultScreen() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            navigation&#x3C;ProfileGraph>(startDestination = ProfileMain) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                composable&#x3C;ProfileMain> { ProfileScreen() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                composable&#x3C;ProfileEdit> { EditProfileScreen() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 底部导航切换时使用 <code>saveState = true</code> 和 <code>restoreState = true</code>，可以保持各 Tab 的页面状态和回退栈。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>NavHost</code> 是导航容器，<code>NavGraph</code> 声明所有可达目的地</li>\n<li>类型安全导航使用 Kotlin Serialization 定义路由，提供编译时类型检查</li>\n<li>Deep Link 通过 <code>navDeepLink</code> 和清单声明实现外部 URL 到应用页面的直接导航</li>\n<li>嵌套导航图通过 <code>navigation&lt;T&gt;</code> 组织相关页面，适合底部导航栏场景</li>\n<li>底部导航切换时配合 <code>saveState</code> / <code>restoreState</code> 保持各 Tab 独立状态</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"导航","id":"导航"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"NavHost 与 NavGraph","id":"navhost-与-navgraph"},{"level":2,"text":"类型安全导航（Kotlin Serialization）","id":"类型安全导航-kotlin-serialization"},{"level":2,"text":"Deep Link","id":"deep-link"},{"level":2,"text":"嵌套导航","id":"嵌套导航"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"布局与修饰符","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/jetpack-compose/layout-and-modifiers"},"next":{"title":"动画","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/jetpack-compose/animation"}}